      "status": "author_approved",
      "note": "The dresser stands near a room corner, leaving a concealed passage between its right side and the wall. The children come around the rear corner with the loose sock already in their possession and drag it forward through this passage. No on-screen dogleg squeeze is required. Final set and textile proof remains a production requirement."
