    {
      "id": "DEC-SOCK-HOOK-HAUL",
      "status": "author_approved",
      "note": "Inside the concealed right-side passage, with the drawer front shielding the children from the room, Vasya uses a cached blunted hook temporarily tied to his permanent shoelace. He anchors to and climbs the real top edge of the drawer's right side panel, lowers the hook for Frosya to attach beneath the sock cuff, and hauls the loose sock. When almost all the cloth is inside, a caught heel releases and sends him backward under the sock. He returns the line, then hangs and drops the remaining short distance. Every complex state change is split across independent short clips."
    }
